                "text": "Last week, on the third anniversary of the Dobbs decision, HHS Secretary Kennedy appeared before @EnergyCommerce, where he admitted and stated clearly that federal law #EMTALA requires hospitals to provide stabilizing medical treatment for pregnant patients, including but not limited to abortion, in all 50 states. This is important for our ER docs and others, as states have banned abortion over the last three years have created confusion and fear that puts patients' lives and health at risk.",
